    <string name="battery_generic">Open Settings → Apps → Flit → Battery and choose Unrestricted (or turn off battery optimization for Flit).</string>
    <string name="battery_samsung">Settings → Apps → Flit → Battery → Unrestricted. Also remove Flit from Settings → Battery → Background usage limits → Sleeping apps.</string>
    <string name="battery_xiaomi">Settings → Apps → Manage apps → Flit → turn on Autostart and set Battery saver to No restrictions.</string>
    <string name="battery_huawei">Settings → Battery → App launch → Flit → turn off automatic management, then allow Auto-launch, Secondary launch and Run in background.</string>
    <string name="battery_oppo">Settings → Battery → Flit (or App battery management) → allow background activity and auto-launch.</string>

